 no action or unrelated content may be modified. The protagonist's lines are kept word-for-word in Chinese, but spoken in an alien voice.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): attribute_transfer——replace the man buying the melon with <Picture 1>.\n<Picture 2> (the original protagonist in <Video 1>): replaced——the man buying the melon is replaced with <Picture 1>; the original man no longer appears; his character position and walking path are inherited by <Picture 1>'s character.\n<Video 1> (scene): fully_preserved——the original street scene is kept in full, with no replacement.\n<Video 1> (camera movement): fully_preserved——the camera movement of every shot is identical to <Video 1>, including handheld shake, tracking angles, shot size and cut timing; none of it may be modified.\n<Video 1> (actions and timing): fully_preserved——all actions, postures, rhythm and timing of the protagonist and every other character are copied exactly from <Video 1>; no action may be added, removed or rewritten.\n<Video 1> (other people and props): fully_preserved——the two fruit vendors, all other people, the fruit stall, camera movement, timing and rhythm remain unchanged.\n<Video 1> (subtitles): fully_preserved——the burned-in Chinese subtitles are identical to the original.\nThe protagonist's voice: replaced——all his lines are spoken in an alien voice, mechanical, electronic, non-human, but the Chinese wording is completely unchanged.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is an edited version of <Video 1>, strictly following <Video 1>'s camera movement, actions and timing shot by shot; only the protagonist's appearance and voice are changed. The scene and everything else remain unchanged. All of the protagonist's actions follow <Video 1> exactly, with no modifications.\n[Shot 1] Handheld tracking shot following the protagonist from the left: camera movement identical to <Video 1>; the character from <Picture 1>, actions exactly as in <Video 1>, the scene remains <Video 1>'s original street scene. As he walks, he calls out to the two people off-screen in an alien voice——mechanical, electronic, slightly reverbed non-human timbre: <d>[Chinese] 生意行吗你们这哥俩。</d> The burned-in subtitles show the same text.\n[Shot 2] Cut to a medium shot of the two vendors sitting behind the fruit stall: camera movement and shot size identical to <Video 1>; the two are kept exactly as in the original, with no changes.\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\nKeep the original action sounds——footsteps, vendors' voices, crowd murmurs, street ambience——identical to the original. Only the protagonist's lines are replaced, now with a metallic synthetic alien timbre and slight electronic echo.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A——the original soundtrack is kept exactly as is."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [411.046875, 635.171875], "pos": [-1437.5987548828125, 3570.869873046875], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [891], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-437.3935546875, 2404.565185546875], "widgets_values": ["nearest-exact", 1.0000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 890, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_by"}, "name": "scale_by", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "系数"}], "flags": {}, "id": 580, "type": "LatentUpsca